(corpus-ch4-057)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *define var
    if (mach > 1.0) {
      x = 1 + mach*mach;
      var = sqrt(x) * table(outx);
    } else {
      var = table(outy);
    }
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when time>1 stop
*end
